    sources: ['Europol', 'Guardia Civil (Spain)'],
    sourceUrl: 'https://www.europol.europa.eu/media-press/newsroom/news/crypto-investment-fraud-ring-dismantled-in-spain-after-defrauding-5-000-victims-worldwide',
